<Slide style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '40px 56px' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, marginBottom: 10 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 32, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>工程化加固</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>从「能跑通」到「敢放到公网」</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flex: 1, gap: 22, marginTop: 12 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
      <Box style={{ height: 6, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
      <Box style={{ padding: '26px 26px 22px', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>多用户数据隔离</Text>
        <Box style={{ gap: 11 }}>
          {[
            '三张业务表统一挂 user_id，归属由服务端写入',
            '越权一律返 404 而非 403，避免探测出 ID 是否存在',
            '旧库启动自动迁移，历史数据划归管理员',
          ].map((t, i) => (
            <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
              <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 6, borderRadius: 3, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 9 }} />
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6, flex: 1 }}>{t}</Text>
            </Box>
          ))}
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
      <Box style={{ height: 6, background: '#3D7BD9' }} />
      <Box style={{ padding: '26px 26px 22px', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>任务配额四层</Text>
        <Box style={{ gap: 11 }}>
          {[
            '全局并发 3 · 单用户并发 2 · 每小时 20 · 每天 60',
            '超限返 429 并带 Retry-After，前端给出明确提示',
            '额度按库里记录统计，重启不清零、换部署绕不过',
          ].map((t, i) => (
            <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
              <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 6, borderRadius: 3, background: '#3D7BD9', marginTop: 9 }} />
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6, flex: 1 }}>{t}</Text>
            </Box>
          ))}
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FDF3F3', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #E8C4C4', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
      <Box style={{ height: 6, background: '#D9534F' }} />
      <Box style={{ padding: '26px 26px 22px', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B23B37' }}>三处安全漏洞修复</Text>
        <Box style={{ gap: 11 }}>
          {[
            '路径穿越：兜底路由曾可匿名读走 .env 与整库',
            '执行沙箱：生成代码曾能读取后端配置中的密钥',
            'CORS 宽配置：任意来源曾被原样回显',
          ].map((t, i) => (
            <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
              <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 6, borderRadius: 3, background: '#D9534F', marginTop: 9 }} />
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6, flex: 1 }}>{t}</Text>
            </Box>
          ))}
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 30px', marginTop: 22 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 46, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>385</Text>
    <Box style={{ gap: 4, flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>项自动化断言：383 通过、2 按环境跳过，另有 25 项线上只读冒烟</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A8C4E8' }}>覆盖访问控制、数据隔离、任务配额、静态托管安全、执行沙箱隔离、凭据链路与日期基准一致性</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
